<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<h2 class="pageDescription" style="margin: 0px; line-height: 1.1em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">Hi&nbsp;</font><span style="font-weight: normal;"><font size="3">{!EBS_Order__c.PO_Contact__c}</font></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">,</font></h2><h2 class="pageDescription" style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.1em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><br>Account: {!EBS_Order__c.Account_Name__c}</font><div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Purchase Order:</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!EBS_Order__c.Customer_PO__c}</span></div><div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sales Order:</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!EBS_Order__c.EBS_Order_Number__c}</span></div><div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 16px;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">This email confirms that one or more of your order lines have been verified as production ready, including artwork (if applicable) and has been released into our production queue.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">To view your order status and order details by line, use this link:&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b><u>{!EBS_Order__c.Tracking_Link_Formula__c}</u></b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;"><b><u><span lang="EN-US"><br></span></u></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="">If the link doesn’t work, copy and paste above URL into your browser.<span style="font-weight: 400;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">Should you have any questions about your order, please reply to this email.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p></div></h2><h2 class="pageDescription" style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.1em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;">All the best,<br>The Koozie Group Customer Care Krew<br></p><a href="https://www.kooziegroup.com/US/" style="color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: none;">kooziegroup.com</a><br></h2>]]></td>
